{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680390/extras/ea1647cb0495a99afeff894e2b1cfbbe.avif?t=1754939182\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anatomy of the Terrible is a small-scale horror experience focused on exploration and puzzle solving in an ever intensifying environment. Enter the home, explore its secrets, do what you can to get out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680390/extras/fdef569a059d79e62cbedfe53fa9a7f7.avif?t=1754939182\" width=616 height=344 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reach Back to the Early Days of Survival Horror</strong> - A vile, low-poly experience awaits you within the chambers of the Ludlow abode. Experience a unique art style handcrafted to be disgusting in all of the best ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound Designed to Scare\u00a0</strong>- Gritty visuals are only half of the horror. Great care and attention to detail has gone into crafting an audio experience that is as upsetting as possible.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680390/extras/046a4b22dd2a059faa6871b05502c566.avif?t=1754939182\" width=616 height=186 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Best of Both Perspectives\u00a0</strong>- Explore the house through our eyes, solve puzzles through yours. A fixed camera system that hides secrets just out of frame and a first person system that makes puzzle solving intuitive and snappy.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short Form Horror </strong>- A compact experience designed to be finished within an hour.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the Bottom of Our Twisted Hearts</strong> - A student capstone, evolved and mutated into an abomination birthed just for you. We hope our creation oozes from your monitor, and that you can't sleep after playing it. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680390?t=1754939182","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680390?t=1754939182","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680390/2691ba2e1bb2cc795fa5cba762f400dc12656ec1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754939182","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680390/2691ba2e1bb2cc795fa5cba762f400dc12656ec1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754939182","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Anatomy of the Terrible depicts blood, corpses, creatures changed beyond recognition and intense mental anguish. There are also frequent allusions to mental health struggles. \r\n"},"demos":[{"appid":3775820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680390/extras/ea1647cb0495a99afeff894e2b1cfbbe.avif?t=1754939182\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anatomy of the Terrible is a small-scale horror experience focused on exploration and puzzle solving in an ever intensifying environment. Enter the home, explore its secrets, do what you can to get out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680390/extras/fdef569a059d79e62cbedfe53fa9a7f7.avif?t=1754939182\" width=616 height=344 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reach Back to the Early Days of Survival Horror</strong> - A vile, low-poly experience awaits you within the chambers of the Ludlow abode. Experience a unique art style handcrafted to be disgusting in all of the best ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound Designed to Scare\u00a0</strong>- Gritty visuals are only half of the horror. Great care and attention to detail has gone into crafting an audio experience that is as upsetting as possible.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680390/extras/046a4b22dd2a059faa6871b05502c566.avif?t=1754939182\" width=616 height=186 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Best of Both Perspectives\u00a0</strong>- Explore the house through our eyes, solve puzzles through yours. A fixed camera system that hides secrets just out of frame and a first person system that makes puzzle solving intuitive and snappy.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short Form Horror </strong>- A compact experience designed to be finished within an hour.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the Bottom of Our Twisted Hearts</strong> - A student capstone, evolved and mutated into an abomination birthed just for you. We hope our creation oozes from your monitor, and that you can't sleep after playing it. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Graveyard Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680390/bd2b4275320c0c520467a13799bff7ca540c457c/header.jpg?t=1754939182","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailer